 "provenance": "Bavaria 1 (w1 l0) normal exit, control-only on the exact S700 core. Start: lives 12 (campaign-style value used by earlier routes), weaponTier 1 (choosing Bavaria on the seal grants the hammer), maxHealth 4, 0 diamonds. Route: tick-timed pass of the column-16 snake and the 89-frame ceiling spikes; grass cut under stone 27,17 destroys crusher 27; stone pushed off 27,20; up column 32 to checkpoint 18,10; stone 16,10 pushed onto crusher 14; column-11 stones dropped; checkpoint 9,12; hammer on grass 7,12 frees the cp3 pocket; column-4 stones settled and one pushed to 3,9; riddle room 0 solved (falling stone 10,2 kills both green snakes after a hammer stun); spike hall timed to checkpoint 29,6; stones at 31-33 rearranged; red snake killed with three hammer hits from 34,4; stone 34,14 pushed onto crusher 33; stone 33,17 pushed into 34,18; gold key chest 35,17; gold lock 33,19; exit 35,20. No damage taken.",
